{%- comment -%}
  Shop policy pages. This MUST be a Liquid template, not JSON: Shopify refuses a
  `templates/policy.json` outright with "Template type 'policy' does not support
  JSON templates", the same rule that applies to gift_card and robots.txt. An
  older `templates/policy.json` did exist on this theme once, so the platform
  tightened this; do not "modernise" it back to JSON.

  Without any policy template Shopify falls back to its own bare
  `.shopify-policy__container` markup and `sections/main-policy.liquid` never
  renders, which is the state this file exists to end.
{%- endcomment -%}
